msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/mediaTypeFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to enforce the at-most-one mediaType identity invariant without introducing a required-value constraint."
msgstr "用于强制执行 mediaType 身份至多一个的约束，而不引入必填值要求。"

