msgid "Exactly one Quantity fills this source slot. Its finite numeric literal keeps its original datatype and spelling; the role asserts no axis origin, direction, unit, sign restriction, corner convention or coordinate conversion."
msgstr "此来源槽恰好关联一个 Quantity。其有限数值字面量保持原始数据类型和拼写；此关系不声明轴原点、方向、单位、正负限制、角点约定或坐标转换。"

